<title>SWITZERLAND: Ciba, Sandoz shares rise.</title>
<headline>Ciba, Sandoz shares rise.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares rose in Ciba-Geigy AG and Sandoz AG after they scheduled a statement at 1500 GMT for news about their planned merger as Novartis.  </p>
<p>Ciba registered shares rose 11 Swiss francs to 1,638 and then slipped back to around 1,630, a gain of three francs over the Monday close.</p>
<p>Sandoz bearer shares added 10 Swiss francs to 1,539 and then also eased back to 1,531, two francs above the overnight price.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
